pei-family","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019","quote":"時西北遠邊有白題及滑國遣使由岷山道入貢，此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔注云：'白題，胡名也。'又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰方國使圖，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至於海表，凡二十國。子野與沛國劉顯、南陽劉之遴、陳郡殷芸、陳留阮孝緒、吳郡顧協、京兆韋棱皆博學，深相賞好，顯尤推重之。時吳平侯蕭勱、范陽張纘每討論墳籍，咸折衷於子野。"}],"rationale":"白題胡名也的注者服虔，梁030同一引漢書注字句、同作者，不由單姓任配。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-cousins:p001","text":"元帝踐阼，徵拜尚書僕射，使崧與協共定中興禮儀。從弟馗早亡，二息序、廞，年各數歲，崧迎與共居，恩同其子。太尉、臨淮公荀顗國胤廢絕，朝庭以崧屬近，欲以崧子襲封。崧哀序孤微，乃讓封與序，論者稱焉。轉太常。時方修學校，簡省博士，置《周易》王氏、《尚書》鄭氏、《古文尚書》孔氏、《毛詩》鄭氏、《周官禮記》鄭氏、《春秋左傳》杜氏服氏、《論語》《孝經》鄭氏博士各一人，凡九人，其《儀禮》、《公羊》、《穀梁》及鄭《易》皆省不置。崧以為不可，乃上疏曰：","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-cousins:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"元帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-cousins:p001:m0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"崧","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-cousins:p001:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"協","kind":"person","person_id":"c20_ec4_36f","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"同句四庫本、武英殿本作「刁協」，《宋書》卷十四亦並記荀崧、刁協。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-cousins:p001:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"馗","kind":"person","person_id":"1ay_9qe_u4h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-cousins:p001:m0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"序","kind":"person","person_id":"1ay_9qe_u4h_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-cousins:p001:m0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"廞","kind":"person","person_id":"1ay_9qe_u4h_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-cousins:p001